.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH RANMA-ATTACH 1 "" "ranma 0.1.0" "ranma manual"
.SH NAME
ranma\-attach \- Attach this terminal to the server NAME, sharing it with any terminal already showing it, or start one by that name
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBranma attach\fR [\fB\-\-steal\fR] [\fB\-\-mobile\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Attach this terminal to the server NAME, sharing it with any terminal already showing it, or start one by that name
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-steal\fR
Send every other terminal showing it away instead of sharing
.TP
\fB\-\-mobile\fR
This terminal is a phone or a tablet, as \fBRANMA_MOBILE=1\fR says
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
The server\*(Aqs name, as \fBranma ls\fR lists it
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBranma\fR(1)
